      "band": "B",
      "evidence": "The spoken answers contain useful sentence structures, but “les dossiers devient” and “les régions voulait” show recurring subject–verb agreement errors. The conditional error in turn 5 was typed, not produced under speaking pressure."
    },
    "vocabulary": {
      "band": "B",
      "evidence": "Terms such as “consultations”, “processus de demande de subventions” and “ateliers” suit the work context. The candidate does not yet use enough precise project-management language to explain the compromise or its results in detail."
    },
    "task": {
      "band": "B",
      "evidence": "The candidate identifies a challenge and her action: “j'ai organisé des ateliers pour trouver un compromis.” She does not explain the compromise reached or the project's outcome. The typed budget response gives a choice, but not why she would make it."
    }
  },
  "fixes": [
